<mxCell id="soc-foot" value="Stay, switch, or revisit. The speaking role does not choose the next role.
If the goal is met early, the session continues and the next move is harder.
Moves: clarify, probe a reason, examine evidence, develop, test a limit,
apply a case, compare, synthesize, or scaffold." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="socratic"><mxGeometry x="24" y="488" width="1224" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
